1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:02,166
(Man:)Uh, we're gonna get started
in a couple minutes. Enjoy.

2
00:00:02,171 --> 00:00:04,241
(Leonard:)Who are you texting?

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,670
(Howard:)Raj. He really wants
to see this movie.

4
00:00:06,676 --> 00:00:08,646
Oh, he'll never
make it in time.

5
00:00:08,644 --> 00:00:11,514
(Leonard:)I know.
I want to make him feel bad.

6
00:00:12,882 --> 00:00:16,352
"Ha, ha. Leonard and I are
about to see Suicide Squad.

7
00:00:16,352 --> 00:00:20,192
Spoiler alert: when I see you
I'm gonna spoil it."

8
00:00:20,189 --> 00:00:22,059
(Leonard:)You're a good friend.

9
00:00:22,058 --> 00:00:23,728
(chuckles)

10
00:00:23,726 --> 00:00:25,996
(phone chimes)

11
00:00:29,699 --> 00:00:32,029
Okay. (clears throat)

12
00:00:33,169 --> 00:00:37,839
(Raj(at the workshop):)Would you ladies please
leave the room for a moment?

13
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,770
(Penny:)Why?

14
00:00:39,776 --> 00:00:43,746
(Raj:)I need to rub my genitals
on their prototype.

15
00:00:43,746 --> 00:00:46,046
(Bernadette:)What's going on?

16
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,418
(Raj:)Leonard and Howard
don't have a flat.

17
00:00:48,418 --> 00:00:50,618
(Raj:)They went to the movies. Look.

18
00:00:51,554 --> 00:00:53,284
(Bernadette:)Son of a bitch.
Un-freakin' believable.

19
00:00:53,289 --> 00:00:55,559
(Raj:)Oh. You know what?
I'm gonna let them know

20
00:00:55,558 --> 00:00:57,858
(Raj:)that I'm here with you
and that they're busted.

21
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,160
(Penny:)No. You know what? Don't. Don't.

